{"ticker":"BEN","updated":"2026-10-30T22:36:57Z","profile":{"longName":"Franklin Templeton Inc.","shortName":"Franklin Templeton, Inc.","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Asset Management","country":"United States","website":"https://www.franklintempleton.com/corporate","fullTimeEmployees":10100,"marketCap":16075552768,"trailingPE":21.52381,"forwardPE":10.014274,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.7240864,"pegRatio":0.4,"targetMeanPrice":35.46154,"targetHighPrice":40.0,"targetLowPrice":26.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":13,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.143,"earningsGrowth":1.067,"grossMargins":0.37707,"operatingMargins":0.12979001,"profitMargins":0.08717,"totalRevenue":9324099584,"beta":1.576,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":36.28,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":21.11,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":4.08},"summary":"Franklin Templeton Inc. is a publicly owned asset investment manager. Through its subsidiaries, the firm provides its services to individuals, institutions, pension plans, trusts, and partnerships. It launches equity, fixed income, balanced, and multi-asset mutual funds through its subsidiaries. The firm invests in the public equity, fixed income, and alternative markets. Franklin Resources, Inc. was founded in 1947 and is based in San Mateo, California with an additional office in Calgary, Alberta; Dubai, United Arab Emirates; Edinburgh, Midlothian; Fort Lauderdale, Florida; Hyderabad, India; London, Greater London; Rancho Cordova, California; Shanghai, Shanghai Province; Singapore; Stamford, Connecticut; and Vienna.","summary_zh":"富蘭克林鄧普頓公司是一家上市資產投資管理公司。該公司透過其子公司向個人、機構、退休金計劃、信託和合夥企業提供服務。它透過其子公司推出股票、固定收益、平衡和多元資產共同基金。該公司投資於公共股權、固定收益和另類市場。 Franklin Resources, Inc. 成立於 1947 年，總部位於加州聖馬特奧，並在阿爾伯塔省卡加利設有辦事處。杜拜，阿拉伯聯合大公國；愛丁堡，中洛錫安；佛羅裡達州勞德代爾堡；印度海得拉巴；倫敦、大倫敦；蘭喬科爾多瓦，加利福尼亞州；上海市，上海市；新加坡;康乃狄克州斯坦福；和維也納。","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"資產管理","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":25.31,"h":25.48,"l":25.02,"c":25.42,"v":3499200},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":